            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Classification of severity of bronchial asthma is a basic point for therapeutic management in adults. In the paper definitions of severe and difficult asthma are presented. The therapeutic possibilities are pointed according to new guidelines published in the recent period and own Author's clinical experience.</AbstractText>
